     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": ", service ends on Tuesday 23 March 2027 at 00:00 UTC, on both Switch and phones. After that, nobody can log in or play a match. The game launched on Switch on 21 July 2021, so it will have lived for less than six years.",
