         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#d7182a"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "What players lose",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#13224b"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ],
    "headingData": {
     "level": 2
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "The good news is that the team is not deleting everything. The ",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "library feature",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "LINK",
         "linkData": {
          "link": {
           "url": "https://unite.pokemon.com/en-us/news/unite-special-event-library-feature/",
           "target": "BLANK",
           "rel": {
            "noreferrer": true
           }
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": " will let players look at the Pokémon and Holowear they own, change outfits and take commemorative photos after the servers close.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "IMAGE",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "CAPTION",
      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textData": {
         "text": "The library: a place to look at what you owned, not to play.",
         "decorations": []
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "imageData": {
     "containerData": {
      "width": {
       "size": "CONTENT"
      },
      "alignment": "CENTER"
     },
     "image": {
      "src": {
       "id": "38ba49_4ef11e9cea714b61b785b1766bff4f78~mv2.jpg"
      },
      "width": 784,
      "height": 441
     },
     "altText": "Pokémon UNITE special event and library feature artwork"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "But a library is not a game. There are no matches in it, no bots and no private lobbies. Its data generally can't be moved to a new device, and support for it ends with the service. The English notice also says nothing about refunds for gems people already bought. ",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "Some outlets",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "LINK",
         "linkData": {
          "link": {
           "url": "https://saiganak.com/news/pokemonunite-end-of-service-announcement/",
           "target": "BLANK",
           "rel": {
            "noreferrer": true
           }
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": " report that the Japanese notice offers refunds for unused paid gems; we haven't been able to confirm that for other regions.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "One more detail stood out to me. After the shutdown, the guidelines that let creators use UNITE footage and images will no longer be maintained. So the game goes, and the rules for talking about it with pictures go with it. That's exactly what the ",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "Stop Killing Games",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "LINK",
         "linkData": {
          "link": {
           "url": "https://www.stopkillinggames.com/",
           "target": "BLANK",
           "rel": {
            "noreferrer": true
           }
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": " campaign is about: when a bought game ends, what's left should still be usable.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
